-reported as `source_text_encoding_ambiguity`. Do not reconstruct lost characters
-or force semantic completeness. Source-review evidence supports exact HTML text
-leaf references as well as element references. When a newly detected source
-ambiguity or corrected source role exposes an incorrect fixture expectation,
-record its before/after values and RAW anchors in the active report. Preserve
-historical reports and source hashes; retain or strengthen the unrelated
-structural assertions.
